    ---
    
    ## The Copilot Developer Prompt
    
    ```text
    Act as an expert Shopify Frontend, Liquid, and CSS developer. Build a fully responsive custom hero section that 100% replicates the structural layout, glassmorphic design layer, spacing, and typography of the provided reference image "image_0bec7b.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** Automatically inherit the active storefront typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout container width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** A full-bleed background hero section. On desktop viewports, content is divided into a 2-column horizontal structure (approx. 55% left column for the value proposition text, 45% right column for the stacked overlay dashboard cards). On mobile, the columns collapse into a single vertical layout with the text block moving to the top and cards stacked cleanly beneath it.
    - **Section Background:** Full-width container featuring a large lifestyle retail background image (as seen in image_0bec7b.jpg, depicting a retail interior with mannequins). The background container should use an absolute-positioned dark tinted overlay layer (rgba color overlay) to ensure high text contrast and legibility.
    
    ### 2. Left Column Layout (Value Proposition Text Block)
    All content elements must be left-aligned and vertically stacked with clean spacing:
    - **Eyebrow Status Badge:** "FLOW LIVE"
      - Styling: Small, bold, all-caps light-gray or white text inside an oval pill capsule layout. Includes a small, vibrant lime-green circular live status dot preceding the text. The capsule features a translucent, semi-transparent dark glass background wash.
    - **Main Heading Text:** "Every customer is a data point.\nEvery data point is an action."
      - Styling: Large, exceptionally bold, high-contrast crisp white text with a explicit line break as shown in the reference image.
    - **Paragraph Description:** "Flow runs quietly in the background — counting, correlating, and surfacing exactly what needs to happen next."
      - Styling: Fine, medium-weight light-gray/blue text with generous line-height to maintain comfortable readability against the dark image backdrop.
    
    ### 3. Right Column Layout (Glassmorphic Data Cards Stack)
    A vertical sequence of 3 floating data blocks stacked on top of each other. Each card block must be designed as a repeatable Liquid block element so users can add, delete, or rearrange them easily.
    - **Card Container Styling:** Features a highly modern frosted-glass glassmorphism effect:
      - Background: Semi-transparent frosted wash (`background: rgba(...)` with a strong CSS `backdrop-filter: blur(...)`).
      - Border: A very thin, faint white/light-gray transparent outer border outline.
      - Shape & Spacing: Clean rounded corners (border-radius: 12px) with comfortable, deep internal padding.
    - **Internal Card Grid Layout:** Elements inside each card are horizontally flexed across three columns/zones:
      - **Left Icon Asset:** A small circular outline or box containing an ultra-clean line-art SVG icon matching the context (e.g., trend up line graph, bar chart, lightning bolt action icon).
      - **Center Data Stack:** Vertically stacked text containing a small, uppercase light-gray title indicator string (e.g., "Entrants today") positioned tightly over a large, bold, crisp white metrics/action string label.
      - **Right Status Tag:** A small metadata or status flag floating on the far right edge of the card flex grid (e.g., lime-green trend metric "+ 8% vs. forecast", muted text "Live", or empty padding depending on block data).
    - **Special Highlight (Card 3):** The third card container uses a distinct transparent dark olive-green glass tint theme to stand out as an actionable insight block.
    
